      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not sure about this. Ammount of drawcalls will be the same, shaders for drawing wireframe not faster than most popular shaders like flat lit toon, and probably even slower than standard shader, so wireframe mode can reduce fps, not increase.\n\nIf the goal to see deactivated player's actions, I guess it's better to request improved \"gray torso\" avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
